── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────────── E0100_for_with_a_condition.lt:3:9  [E0100]

Stilt loops while a condition holds with `while`:

  3 │   for i < 3 { i += 1 }
    │         ^

`while c { … }` runs as long as `c` holds, `loop { … }` until a `break`, and
`for x in xs` takes each value of `xs`.

To fix it, write `while`:

  3 │   while i < 3 { i += 1 }
    │   ~~~~~
